  "description": "The Bars MVVM library is an optional companion to the Bars product, which includes advanced fluent ribbons, toolbars, menus, and related controls, and has been built from the ground up to support MVVM creation of the entire user interface if desired.\n\nThis open-source companion MVVM library provides a full set of view models and related UI bindings to easily configure and manage your ribbons, toolbars, and menus.\n\nDocumentation is available on the Actipro web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/docs/controls/avalonia/index?v=26.1), and samples can be downloaded from the Actipro Avalonia Controls GitHub repository (https://github.com/Actipro/Avalonia-Controls).\n\nNOTE: This is a commercial software product and requires proper paid licensing for legal usage. See Actipro's web site (https://www.actiprosoftware.com/purchase) for links to purchase developer licenses, or view the Sales FAQ for more information about evaluations and licensing.",
